---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import workshop from '../../assets/workshop.jpg';
import VideoEvidence from '../../components/VideoEvidence.astro';
---
<Base title="Coaching for your direction, story & voice" description="Work with Loren Michaels Harris on message clarity, story structure, delivery, and direction. Explore focused coaching and The Mindset Revolution.">
<section class="section wrap coaching-opening"><div class="coaching-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">COACHING WITH LOREN MICHAELS HARRIS</p><h1>You have<br/>something<br/><span class="gold-text">to say.</span></h1></div><div class="coaching-lead"><p>For leaders, founders, and emerging speakers who want to communicate with clarity. Work on what you mean, how you structure it, and how you share it.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/?service=coaching">Discuss coaching ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="#coaching-options">Find your starting point ↓</a></div></div></div><figure class="coaching-photo reveal"><Image src={workshop} alt="Loren talking with participants gathered around a table during a workshop" widths={[400,800,1200,1600]} sizes="(max-width:767px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1376px) calc(100vw - 96px), 1280px" format="webp" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption class="metadata">A workshop from Loren’s published collection · Photograph: Raducu Popa</figcaption></figure></section>
<section class="section light-section"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">THE WORK WE CAN DO TOGETHER</p><h2>Find the message.<br/>Practice sharing it.</h2><div class="topic-columns"><article><h3>Message clarity</h3><p>Identify what you want people to understand and why it matters. Bring a leadership challenge, a talk, or a story you’re struggling to express.</p></article><article><h3>Story structure</h3><p>Find the thread that connects your experience to your audience. Shape the material into a message people can follow.</p></article><article><h3>Delivery & presence</h3><p>Work with your voice, pacing, and connection with the room. Make deliberate choices about how you communicate your message.</p></article></div></div></section>
<VideoEvidence/>
<section class="section wrap" id="coaching-options"><p class="eyebrow">A FORMAT THAT FITS THE WORK</p><h2>Start with the goal.<br/>Choose the support.</h2><div class="coaching-options"><article><p class="eyebrow">FOCUSED COACHING</p><h3>A message you want<br/>to work on now.</h3><p>Discuss individual coaching around your communication, a talk, or an important professional moment. Bring your starting material and the question you want to address.</p><p>Goals, session cadence, availability, and scope are agreed directly before work begins.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/?service=coaching">Tell us what you’re working on ↗</a></article><article><p class="eyebrow">MASTERCLASS & COACHING EXPERIENCE</p><h3>The Mindset<br/>Revolution</h3><p class="program-facts">12 weeks · 12 classes · 12 private coaching calls</p><p>For people examining their direction and developing a message or body of work. Complete three self-paced classes weekly during the first four weeks, with one private, 60-minute coaching call in each of the twelve weeks.</p><a class="text-link" href="/the-mindset-revolution/">Explore the full program ↗</a></article></div></section>
<section class="section light-section"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR FIRST CONVERSATION</p><h2>Bring the question<br/>you keep coming back to.</h2></div><div><p>Tell Loren what you want to work on, where you feel stuck, and whether you have an event or deadline in mind. That context helps you discuss the right starting point.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/?service=coaching">Discuss coaching ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap booking-alternative"><p>Prefer to talk through your ideas? <a href="https://calendly.com/lorenmichaelsharris">Schedule a call with Loren ↗</a></p></section>
</Base>
<style>
.coaching-opening{padding-top:64px}.coaching-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,.9fr);gap:72px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:48px}.coaching-intro h1{margin-bottom:0;font-size:clamp(64px,7.3vw,112px)}.coaching-lead{padding-bottom:8px}.coaching-lead p{color:var(--muted);max-width:560px}.coaching-photo img{width:100%;height:auto}.coaching-options{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:56px;margin-top:44px}.coaching-options article{border-top:1px solid #8c7741;padding-top:28px}.coaching-options p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--muted)}.coaching-options .program-facts{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}@media(max-width:767px){.coaching-opening{padding-top:40px}.coaching-intro,.coaching-options{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.coaching-intro h1{font-size:clamp(56px,14vw,88px)}.coaching-intro{margin-bottom:36px}}
</style>
